{"title":"2026 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_STEM_Simplified\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by STEM Simplified</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Thinking_Feet\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Thinking Feet</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_in_Chinese_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution in Chinese by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of this expression?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/3/53339af2ba0a07a3787619b165647264c9e24e83.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\sqrt{16\\sqrt{81}}}{\\sqrt{81\\sqrt{16}}}\\]\" width=\"69\" height=\"50\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/a/54a3cbfacb00e52a86dff4196d94fa300d3b1a2d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\textbf{(A)} \\hspace{3pt} \\frac{4}{9} \\hspace{19pt} \\textbf{(B)} \\hspace{3pt} \\frac{2}{3} \\hspace{19pt} \\textbf{(C)} \\hspace{3pt} 1 \\hspace{19pt} \\textbf{(D)} \\hspace{3pt} \\frac{3}{2} \\hspace{19pt} \\textbf{(E)} \\hspace{3pt} \\frac{9}{4}\\]\" width=\"352\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The inner square root cannot be negative. If the outer square root is negative, the denominator is also negative, resulting in a positive fraction, an identity. Thus, we only consider positive squares, in which the numerator simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/a/5aabf57c1b14494ad707fcf95d847952a4b78e6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{16 \\cdot 9} = \\sqrt{16}\\sqrt{9} = 4 \\cdot 3 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"237\" height=\"21\" />, and the denominator simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/5/c055fa4de5fe08e3aead6ec616c8da67abcdd8f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{81 \\cdot 4} = \\sqrt{81}\\sqrt{4} = 9 \\cdot 2 = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"237\" height=\"21\" />. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/3/e13e053682cf3de24d9fabb6ccaf61a9faf300c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{12}{18} = \\frac{4}{6} = \\boxed{\\frac{2}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"110\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p><p>(Other solutions weren't explicit with logic).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbd1200c10c8c598136837496bec32e6c719bd89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{81} = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/2/6320b3f67b9e4021ebd6feac95c4b5d97004195f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{16} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" />, we can simplify this expression to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/1/431896eac99445f51a20135827a6c6dac8e52370.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{16\\cdot 9}}{\\sqrt{81\\cdot 4}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{144}}{\\sqrt{324}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"132\" height=\"48\" />, which can be calculated to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/e/a1e70900d00facd36b87d6010d4d39aad705a33c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{12}{18} = \\boxed{ \\textbf{(B) } \\frac{2}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"107\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>~OlympiadMaster\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/4/194964c05be1ef9724d58b244b40ca6cab7d207d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{16\\sqrt{81}}}{\\sqrt{81\\sqrt{16}}}=\\frac{4\\sqrt{\\sqrt{81}}}{9\\sqrt{\\sqrt{16}}}=\\frac{4\\times3}{9\\times2}=\\frac{12}{18}=\\frac23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"316\" height=\"53\" />, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/0/b60f1efd7df627b8396b9946b1100623fcc5f6cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{(B) } \\frac{2}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"61\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>~Yuhao2012\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/8/068ec3c3eb8dd251eb3907f66006a6c3b4b14de8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{16\\sqrt{81}}}{\\sqrt{81\\sqrt{16}}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{16\\cdot9}}{\\sqrt{81\\cdot4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"159\" height=\"53\" /> Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/2/d52e813743234af7df912ae2474c18fccbbb1d14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16=4^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/3/983909d4e4acd04184f1eee0a535409d3a8df27b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9=3^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/0/700205bed2c6bf961c7c5f30a7b330109d28602a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81=9^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/e/8ee7bdef8e80ae4acedb43e873e41684ac66353a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4=2^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />. We also know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/a/d2a08d5b52fddedb5827eff2128610eeac2bfc8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 y^2 = (xy)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"21\" />. \nSo this equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/9/2a9a94ef1a588148d4d024fa69d2b85935a698cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{4^2\\cdot3^2}}{\\sqrt{9^2\\cdot2^2}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{(4\\cdot3)^2}}{\\sqrt{(9\\cdot2)^2}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{12^2}}{\\sqrt{18^2}}=\\frac{12}{18}=\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"319\" height=\"51\" />, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/0/b60f1efd7df627b8396b9946b1100623fcc5f6cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{(B) } \\frac{2}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"61\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>~ppatruni2013 from Carnage MS\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/7/0e71b0ed9f23b26aa996f1d2cdd3b89a719a7300.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{81} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"21\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/2/6320b3f67b9e4021ebd6feac95c4b5d97004195f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{16} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" />, the numerator of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/7/2879c393ea034947128a19d783f5529dae84a3b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{16\\sqrt{81}}}{\\sqrt{81\\sqrt{16}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"75\" height=\"53\" /> becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/0/86050f9036183ec19405814909c9573c49bfcd8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\cdot 3 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />. To find the denominator's value, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/4/9447dd9e4bda47eef909066366fa86ffa06fab81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{16} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"21\" />, and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbd1200c10c8c598136837496bec32e6c719bd89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{81} = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"21\" />, the denominator of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/7/2879c393ea034947128a19d783f5529dae84a3b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{16\\sqrt{81}}}{\\sqrt{81\\sqrt{16}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"75\" height=\"53\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/2/822d6b4f53b3c52afe4f053498b8c52ee9d82e31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\cdot 2 = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />. We are left with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/4/b143fac05b4adc6bf7fd8d2947f95b4f6a77045b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{12}{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" />. After further simplification, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/0/b60f1efd7df627b8396b9946b1100623fcc5f6cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{(B) } \\frac{2}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"61\" height=\"49\" />.\n~Ingeniouspeacock36\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/gzXlOkLl24U\">https://youtu.be/gzXlOkLl24U</a>\n</p><p>~TheSmartGreekMathDude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/nY1hhVbEeBk\">https://youtu.be/nY1hhVbEeBk</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_STEM_Simplified\">Video Solution by STEM Simplified</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by STEM Simplified\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fBoAgkG0m2I\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fBoAgkG0m2I</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Thinking_Feet\">Video Solution by Thinking Feet</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Thinking Feet\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/cbS6GQLEVbQ\">https://youtu.be/cbS6GQLEVbQ</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_.28AIME_Qualifier.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3GmtxMC-W1I&amp;t=801s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3GmtxMC-W1I&amp;t=801s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_in_Chinese_by_SquishBJ_.28AIME_Qualifier.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_in_Chinese_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\">Video Solution in Chinese by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution in Chinese by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://